# Raw Knesset vote-results database — 234MB, not meant to be distributed, and not needed by the
# deployed site anyway (wiki-prototype.html self-embeds everything it serves; vercel.json only
# rewrites "/" to that one file). .gitignore already excludes this from the repo, so GitHub-
# triggered deploys never see it — this file exists for the fallback case of deploying directly
# from the local working directory, which doesn't consult .gitignore on its own.
data/knesset_votes.sqlite3
